5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited for the new season! But I feel like we always get surprised by the bills. Can we look into where the money actually goes?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree that we need a realistic view. I'm worried about who is actually available to manage the workload this time.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Budget and staff are boring. We should focus on what actually brings people through the doors. The data should tell us that.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We cannot ignore the physical limits of the gallery. If we promise a space we can't structurally support, we'll have a disaster.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It would be lovely to ensure everything arrives on time. I hate it when we have to apologize to guests because a piece is missing.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, that's true! But maybe we can check the mount-making costs too? Those always seem to add up.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, visitor numbers matter, but not if the staff are too exhausted to greet them. We need to check the roster.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, a great exhibition attracts its own energy. I want to see the head counts from previous seasons.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, costs are important, but a structural failure is more expensive. I'll be looking at the suspended bay.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think looking into the lender paperwork might show us why those delays happen.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll also check the loan transport costs. I suspect that's a huge hidden drain.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into the conservation lab staffing. I suspect there's a backlog we're ignoring.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll also check the visitor comment slips. I want to know what they actually want.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I should also check the evening hire bookings. We can't have the exhibition blocking the rental income.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I'll look into the transport costs as well, just to see the full picture of the delivery struggle.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
