35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, transport and insurance are eating a third of our installation budget! And bespoke mounts are getting way too expensive.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"It's worse than I thought. The lab is down to one person, and the volunteer roster is mostly just one specific local group.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Interesting. People hate empty galleries. They want to see people working or talking, and they love moving displays.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and our evening hires mean we can't have fragile things that can't be moved.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,It's not just the money; the paperwork from distant lenders is causing us to miss shipping cut-offs.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, so we should avoid distant loans entirely to save money and stress!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Asuka, if we have a huge backlog in the lab, we can't take on anything that needs heavy stabilization.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, if we avoid loans, we need something dynamic. Static cases are a turn-off for the crowds.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Victoria, that means any exhibition with a ""working bench"" or heavy equipment needs to be carefully placed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Mio. Local items would be much safer and more reliable for our timeline.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,Exactly! Let's prioritize things that don't need expensive crates or international couriers.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,And we must avoid anything that requires intense conservation work right now. We simply don't have the hands.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"But it has to be engaging. If it's just local crafts in boxes, the weekend numbers will tank.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"We also need to ensure the layout doesn't interfere with the evening bookings. No permanent, bulky installations in the way.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"A gentle, local approach seems best for everyone's peace of mind.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
