60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Okay, looking at the candidates: A is local, B is high-tech, C is loan-heavy, and D is local with a bench. I like A or D.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"B sounds like a maintenance nightmare, and D requires the conservation lab. A uses volunteers, which we have.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,"A is too quiet. B is perfect for numbers, but D's working bench satisfies the ""human presence"" the visitors want.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,B's rigging might be too heavy for the bay. C's loans are a risk. D's bench is fine if it's not in the way.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"C is far too risky with the paperwork. A is lovely and safe, but D also feels very community-oriented.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, D is great because it's local, so no huge transport costs!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, but D has a ""working conservation bench."" I just told you the lab is drowning! We can't add more work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, the bench is for visitors to watch, not necessarily for the staff to clear the backlog.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Victoria, if the bench is just a display, it's fine. But B's overhead rigging is a definite no for me.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"A is the most peaceful choice. No stress, no shipping delays, just local beauty.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm torn between A and D. Both save money.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,A is the only one that doesn't put more pressure on the exhausted staff.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,I'll vote for D. It's the best compromise between engagement and logistics.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I agree with D. It's manageable and doesn't threaten the ceiling or the floor.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I still feel A is the kindest choice for the team.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,I'll go with D. It's more exciting than A but cheaper than B or C.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I'll stick with A. We need to breathe.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,D is the winner for the visitors.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Asuka,,D is the most logical fit for the building.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"I will vote for A, for the sake of simplicity.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
